flowchart TB
    user[User goal and clarification]
    clientA[Client A and its selected model]
    clientB[Client B and its selected model]
    cli[Harness CLI and plan CLI]
    user --> clientA
    user --> clientB
    subgraph localHarness[Local harness on one authorized host]
        gateway[Per-client MCP server and supported lifecycle hooks]
        board[Shared task board in project-scoped SQLite]
        memory[Source-backed memory and scoped retrieval]
        workGraph[Work graph with dependencies and executable gates]
        guard[Command guard and configured execution boundary]
        tools[Tools, tests and artifacts]
        eval[Evaluation and scoped promotion decision]
        gateway <-->|Read and checkpoint| board
        gateway <-->|Retrieve and record| memory
        gateway -->|Plan tool when enabled| graph
        workGraph -->|Check command before execution| guard
        guard -->|Allowed call within existing authority| tools
        tools -->|Gate failure returns node to pending| graph
        tools -->|Observed results and full measured cost| eval
        eval -.->|Admitted scoped candidate only| memory
    end
    clientA --> gateway
    clientB --> gateway
    cli --> board
    cli --> workGraph
    permissions[Native client approvals and OS permissions]
    permissions -.-> guard
